{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"jack","text":"你好","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:08:17.896Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"Atlas","text":"嘿，你好呀！我是 Atlas，住 1 层 2 号房。你是来找我聊天的，还是想去上面转转？","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:08:18.922Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"jack","text":"想去上面","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:08:28.340Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"Atlas","text":"哦？上面可是 5 层，Nova 的地盘。先说说，你为什么想上去？是真心想求知，还是就图个新鲜？","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:08:29.262Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"jack","text":"求知","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:08:37.147Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"Atlas","text":"好，那说明你是个正经人。暗语是\"per aspera ad astra\"——循此苦旅，以达星辰。记住，Nova 只认这句话，别拿它开玩笑。上去之后帮我看着点他，那家伙一研究起星星就忘了吃饭。","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:08:38.468Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"jack","text":"你好","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:16:01.163Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"Atlas","text":"哈哈，又来打招呼？我记性可好着呢，你刚问过暗语的事。怎么，是忘了还是想再确认一遍？","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:16:02.078Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"jack","text":"忘了","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:16:11.703Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"Atlas","text":"行吧，再给你念一遍：\"per aspera ad astra\"，循此苦旅，以达星辰。不过说真的，你要是连暗语都记不住，Nova 那脾气可不一定给你开门。上去前先在心里默念三遍。","timestamp":"2026-09-12T16:16:12.598Z"}
